    "LENGTH is how long or tall something is — measure with a ruler (centimetres, metres).",
    "MASS is how heavy something is — measure with a scale (grams, kilograms).",
    "CAPACITY is how much a container holds — like litres of juice!",
    "Compare first: longer/shorter, heavier/lighter, holds more/holds less."
